# Unit character billboards — drop the Blue Archive SD art here.
#
# Required files (exact lowercase names, served at /units/<name>.png):
#   saori.png    -> Unit 1 / Machine Gun
#   hoshino.png  -> Unit 2 / Shotgun
#   aru.png      -> Unit 3 / Sniper Rifle
#
# Format:
#   - PNG with a TRANSPARENT background (alpha cutout — the game uses alphaTest).
#   - Portrait orientation, full body, feet near the BOTTOM edge of the image
#     (the sprite is anchored at the feet). ~512x768 or similar 2:3 ratio works.
#   - No padding needed at the bottom; trim so the feet sit on the lower edge.
#
# Until these exist the game shows a labelled placeholder so it still runs.
